WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.569
-Guys, whenever I get some
downtime here at the show,

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:04.670
I like to go on Instagram

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.272
and I just scroll through
all the photos.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.807
That's how I do it.

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:11.377
My downtime, I'm just like...

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:12.545
I've got a touch screen.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:16.982
Yeah, a big touch screen.
I got the new iPhone 16.

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:20.320
Suckers are about yea big.
-Really? Two hands?

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.622
-Oh, yeah. I'm just like...
I'm like, "Hello.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.756
You're on speakerphone.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:27.760
When are you not
on speakerphone?"

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.363
'Cause the speaker
is so big on the phone.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.899
So, anyhoo,
I got the 16 mini, though.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:36.536
So it's about --
It's about yea big.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.737
So, I flipped through Instagram
just going like,

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:38.905
"Oh, yeah, yeah."

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.173
I feel like, you know,
Kornacki over there.

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:44.343
And one thing I've noticed --
that, a lot of times,

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.178
two people will write
the exact same caption,

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:48.548
but the pictures they post
will be completely different.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.749
-Mm-hmm.
-Yeah.

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.517
I'll show you what I mean
in this next segment.

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.218
It's time for "Picture This."

00:00:53.218 --> 00:00:56.389
-♪ Picture this, picture this,
picture this ♪

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.190
♪ Yeah, picture this ♪

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.326
-Alright, let's take a look at
this first example of

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:04.597 line:0%
Joe Biden and Kamala Harris both
wrote, "Bright things ahead."

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:05.965 line:0%
Joe Biden posted a picture of

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.968 line:0%
Kamala as the first female VP.

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.903 line:0%
Kamala Harris posted
a picture of

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:13.039 line:0%
Joe Biden's teeth.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:15.274 line:0%
See, it's the same caption
but different things.

00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:17.010 line:0%
Yeah, like,
this next one is from

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.646 line:0%
the Trump campaign
and also Tim Cook.

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:22.348 line:0%
They both wrote, "Lose one,
and it's all over."

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:23.916 line:0%
Trump campaign posted
a picture of

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:25.418 line:0%
the swing states.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.086 line:0%
Tim Cook posted a picture of

00:01:27.086 --> 00:01:28.721 line:0%
AirPods, yeah.

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.190 line:0%
You lose one...
-It's all over.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:35.294 line:0%
-Here's one from Quibi and
Claire of "The Bachelorette."

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:38.797 line:0%
They both wrote,
"Damn, that was fast."

00:01:38.797 --> 00:01:40.099 line:0%
Quibi posted a picture of

00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:41.100 line:0%
Claire.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.402 line:0%
Claire posted a picture of

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.104 line:0%
Quibi.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.476 line:0%
Here's one from Stacey Abrams
and Steve Kornacki.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:52.778 line:0%
They both wrote,
"Let's do this."

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:54.346 line:0%
Stacey Abrams
posted a picture of

00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:56.081 line:0%
the Georgia run-offs.

00:01:56.081 --> 00:01:57.283 line:0%
Kornacki posted a picture of...

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.953 line:0%
his bed and a bottle of ZzzQuil.

00:02:01.687 --> 00:02:04.457
What's the difference with
ZzzQuil and NyQuil?

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.892
Because when I drink NyQuil,
I ZzzQuil.

00:02:06.892 --> 00:02:09.495
-Yeah, I think ZzzQuil
helps you get your Z's.

00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:10.897
-What does NyQuil do?

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:14.533
-It's the nighttime, sniffly,
sneezy, coughy, head --

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:16.435
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Do you get paid?

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:18.171
Are you a paid spokesman?

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:21.941
I mean, why not just take --
Doesn't NyQuil make you sleep?

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:23.009
-I mean, not me.

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:27.246
But ZzzQuil --
talking some serious Z's.

00:02:27.246 --> 00:02:29.181
-E's?
-Z's.

00:02:29.181 --> 00:02:31.684
Well, that's E-qual.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.320
Comes in a little packet.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:38.024
-Sugar substitute. Yeah, yeah.
E-quals. Yeah.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:40.893
Moving on, here's one from...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:43.029
E-quals.

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.597
Here's one from a dog and a cat.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.065
They both wrote,

00:02:46.065 --> 00:02:48.567 line:0%
"I love him and worship him
and would do anything for him."

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:49.669 line:0%
Aww.

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.804 line:0%
The dog posted a picture of
his owner.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:53.206 line:0%
The cat posted a picture of

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:54.440 line:0%
Satan.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.176 line:0%
-Yeah, that's about right.
-Yeah.

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:58.277 line:0%
-Here's the last one here.

00:02:58.277 --> 00:03:00.713 line:0%
It's from Governor Cuomo
and Melania Trump.

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.448 line:0%
They both wrote,
"Two more months, tops."

00:03:03.448 --> 00:03:04.550 line:0%
Cuomo posted a picture of

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.318 line:0%
outdoor dining in New York.

00:03:06.318 --> 00:03:07.820 line:0%
Melania posted a picture of
her marriage license.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.088 line:0%
There you go.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.391 line:0%
That's all the time we have for
"Picture This."

